# Real ballot-level preference data for the 2012 Shetland Islands Council election,
# Shetland South ward (4 candidates, 3 seats). Converted from the CSV preference profile at
# https://github.com/mggg/scot-elex/blob/main/4_cands/shetland_2012_ward5.csv (MGGG's public
# archive of real Scottish STV preference profiles for 2012/2017/2022, described in
# arXiv:2605.12676). Cross-checked against Wikipedia's "Shetland South (ward)" page: 1508
# valid votes, first preferences Duncan 685 / Smith 418 / Fox 337 / Shearer 68, and Duncan,
# Smith, and Fox (not Shearer) elected — this file reproduces all of that exactly when run
# with the "scottish" ruleset (Droop quota + WIGM + truncate to 5 decimal places).
